WEBVTT

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:00.582
Mwana historia atasema

00:03:00.606 --> 00:03:03.778
Sweden haijawahi kuwa katika mgogoro wa 
wa kitaifa kwa miaka takriban 200.

00:03:03.802 --> 00:03:06.082
Uganda bado inahangaika 
na migomo

00:03:06.106 --> 00:03:07.973
kaskazini mwa nchi.

00:03:09.331 --> 00:03:11.045
Mwanamuziki anaweza kusema

00:03:11.069 --> 00:03:15.363
kuwa Uganda, wimbo wa taifa,
"Oh Uganda, Ardhi ya Uzuri"

00:03:15.387 --> 00:03:17.133
ni moja kati ya fupi sana ulimwenguni.

00:03:17.157 --> 00:03:19.696
Fupi mno,
Mara nyingi inachezwa zaidi ya mara moja.

00:03:20.022 --> 00:03:23.582
Ninaamini Sweden hucheza yao
na kuimba yao muda mrefu zaidi.

00:03:24.765 --> 00:03:26.654
Lakini kwa kumaanisha zaidi,

00:03:26.678 --> 00:03:28.916
Sweden na Uganda walifanya makubaliano,

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:30.998
wana muunganiko mmoja 
na kusudi moja,